15:41:15 --- repl-help: HELP
15:41:15 Commands:
15:41:15   BEGINCFG ... ENDCFG        - add sensor config (multi-line)
15:41:15   BEGINCFG|k=v|...|ENDCFG    - add sensor config (inline with '|', supports \|)
15:41:15   BEGINRULE ... ENDRULE      - add rule (multi-line)
15:41:15   BEGINRULE|k=v|...|ENDRULE  - add rule (inline with '|', supports \|)
15:41:15   RUN / STOP                 - control sampling
15:41:15   CLEAR                      - clear sensors + rules
15:41:15   SHOW / SHOWRULES           - show sensors / rules
15:41:15   CLEARRULES                 - clear only rules
15:41:15   HELP                       - this text
15:41:15 
15:41:15 Example inline rule (HMC5883L big-endian X,Z,Y at 0x03):
15:41:15 BEGINRULE|name=GY511_MAG|source=GY511_ACC|calc=mx=s16be(0)|calc=mz=s16be(2)|calc=my=s16be(4)|calc=mag=sqrt(mx*mx+my*my+mz*mz)|when=mag>350|action=log:MAG change detected|ENDRULE
